unchanged; do not commit, push, merge, or comment. Do not reset usage limits, buy allowance, or switch models/providers; stop on a usage limit. Review the final saved correction against the normal Issue #413 scope. Confirm generic preview-only errors do not stop page-mic recording or prevent the next final insertion. Ensure insertion/shared path failures retain their required semantics, both required hosts remain supported, and applicable mandatory checks pass on the actual PR head. Use proportionate existing evidence and focused reproduction. No exhaustive edge cases, physical checks or human gate. A reproducible material failure or missing required check blocks merge.",
